<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:30:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>风险偏好回归，铜价自 11 个月低点反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite</link><description>铜价与亚洲科技股一起从 11 个月低点反弹，因人工智能交易担忧引发的数周波动后，市场风险偏好有所回升。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite'&gt;风险偏好回归，铜价自 11 个月低点反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Surges the Most in 10 Months as Risk Appetite Returns&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:33:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Futures Rally as Tech Rebound Gains Momentum: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>尽管埃尔多安做出承诺，土耳其基金投资者仍面临本金损失</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/turkey-fund-investors-face-principal-loss-despite-erdogan-pledge</link><description>土耳其副总统杰夫代特·耶尔马兹 (Cevdet Yilmaz) 表示，清算投资基金的付款将基于其持有资产的市场价格，这表明许多小投资者可能无法收回全部本金。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/turkey-fund-investors-face-principal-loss-despite-erdogan-pledge'&gt;尽管埃尔多安做出承诺，土耳其基金投资者仍面临本金损失&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Turkey Fund Investors Face Principal Loss Despite Erdogan Pledge&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/turkey-fund-investors-face-principal-loss-despite-erdogan-pledge</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:13:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>经过数周的人工智能焦虑后，股市牛市再次骚动</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/stock-bulls-stir-again-after-weeks-of-ai-anxiety</link><description>交易员正在为短期反弹提供理由。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/stock-bulls-stir-again-after-weeks-of-ai-anxiety'&gt;经过数周的人工智能焦虑后，股市牛市再次骚动&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stock Bulls Stir Again After Weeks of AI Anxiety&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/stock-bulls-stir-again-after-weeks-of-ai-anxiety</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:16:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</link><description>随着感恩节假期后市场重新开放，美国国债交投清淡，亚洲股市上涨抑制了对避险资产的需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens'&gt;股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Dip on Weaker Demand for Havens as Stocks Rebound&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:43:08 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>